    "body": "The humming MoE backend expects pre-quantized checkpoint scales and crashes during weight conversion with a bare KeyError: \\'weight_scale\\' when paired with online MXFP8 quantization. This passes is_online=True from Mxfp8OnlineMoEMethod to the MXFP8 oracle so explicit --moe-backend humming raises a clear ValueError with suggested alternatives while auto-selection skips humming in favor of triton. Pre-quantized ModelOpt checkpoints continue to resolve to humming unchanged.\n\nFixes #62136",
